
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "64c53340-5bae-4a2b-8131-416b3b904e3f",
    "name": "CF7 Webhook Email Notifications",
    "description": "# CF7 Webhook Email Notifications\n\nThis collection handles real-time form submission webhooks from WordPress sites using **Contact Form 7 (CF7)** and the **UACF7 (Ultra Addons for Contact Form 7)** plugin.\n\n## How it works\n\nWhen a visitor submits a Contact Form 7 form on your WordPress site, the UACF7 plugin fires a POST webhook to the configured endpoint. This collection receives that webhook, stores the form data, and automatically sends two emails via the [Resend](https://resend.com) API:\n\n1. A **staff notification** email to your team\n    \n2. A **confirmation email** back to the person who submitted the form\n    \n\n## WordPress Setup\n\n1. Install and activate **Contact Form 7** and **Ultra Addons for Contact Form 7 (UACF7)** on your WordPress site\n    \n2. In your WordPress admin, go to **Ultra Addons > All Addons** and enable the **Webhook** addon\n    \n3. Open your CF7 form and go to the **Ultra Addons for CF7 Options > Webhook** tab\n    \n4. Toggle **Enable Webhook** to ON\n    \n5. Set the **Request URL** to your endpoint (replace the mock URL with your production URL)\n    \n6. Set the **Request Method** to `POST`\n    \n7. Set the **Request Format** to `JSON`\n    \n8. In the **Request Body** section, map your CF7 fields: `your-name` → `name`, `your-email` → `email`, `your-message` → `message`\n    \n9. Save the form settings and submit a test entry to verify\n    \n\n## Required Variables\n\n| Variable | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| `{{resend_api_key}}` | Your Resend API key (from resend.com/api-keys) |\n| `{{sender_email}}` | The From address — must be a verified domain in Resend |\n| `{{notification_email}}` | Staff email address to receive form submission alerts |\n\n## Expected Webhook Payload\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"name\": \"{{form_name}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{form_email}}\",\n  \"message\": \"{{form_message}}\",\n  \"submitted_at\": \"{{submitted_at}}\"\n}\n\n ```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "58683638",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/58683638-64c53340-5bae-4a2b-8131-416b3b904e3f?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Receive Form Submission",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Parse the incoming form submission",
              "const body = pm.request.body ? JSON.parse(pm.request.body.raw) : {};",
              "",
              "// Store form details as collection variables",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"form_name\", body.name || \"\");",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"form_email\", body.email || \"\");",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"form_message\", body.message || \"\");",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"submitted_at\", body.submitted_at || new Date().toISOString());",
              "",
              "const senderEmail = pm.collectionVariables.get(\"sender_email\");",
              "const resendApiKey = pm.collectionVariables.get(\"resend_api_key\");",
              "const formName = pm.collectionVariables.get(\"form_name\");",
              "const formEmail = pm.collectionVariables.get(\"form_email\");",
              "const formMessage = pm.collectionVariables.get(\"form_message\");",
              "const submittedAt = pm.collectionVariables.get(\"submitted_at\");",
              "const notificationEmail = pm.collectionVariables.get(\"notification_email\");",
              "",
              "// Send notification email to staff",
              "pm.sendRequest({",
              "    url: \"https://api.resend.com/emails\",",
              "    method: \"POST\",",
              "    header: {",
              "        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",",
              "        \"Authorization\": \"Bearer \" + resendApiKey",
              "    },",
              "    body: {",
              "        mode: \"raw\",",
              "        raw: JSON.stringify({",
              "            from: senderEmail,",
              "            to: [notificationEmail],",
              "            subject: \"New Form Submission Received\",",
              "            text: \"You have received a new form submission.\\n\\nName: \" + formName + \"\\nEmail: \" + formEmail + \"\\nMessage: \" + formMessage + \"\\nSubmitted at: \" + submittedAt",
              "        })",
              "    }",
              "}, function(err, res) {",
              "    if (err) {",
              "        console.log(\"Staff notification email error:\", err);",
              "    } else {",
              "        console.log(\"Staff notification email sent:\", res.status);",
              "    }",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Send confirmation email to form submitter",
              "pm.sendRequest({",
              "    url: \"https://api.resend.com/emails\",",
              "    method: \"POST\",",
              "    header: {",
              "        \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",",
              "        \"Authorization\": \"Bearer \" + resendApiKey",
              "    },",
              "    body: {",
              "        mode: \"raw\",",
              "        raw: JSON.stringify({",
              "            from: senderEmail,",
              "            to: [formEmail],",
              "            subject: \"Form Submission Received\",",
              "            text: \"Hey, thanks for reaching out!\\n\\nWe received your form submission and will be in touch soon.\\n\\nHere are the details you submitted:\\n\\nName: \" + formName + \"\\nEmail: \" + formEmail + \"\\nMessage: \" + formMessage + \"\\nSubmitted at: \" + submittedAt",
              "        })",
              "    }",
              "}, function(err, res) {",
              "    if (err) {",
              "        console.log(\"Confirmation email error:\", err);",
              "    } else {",
              "        console.log(\"Confirmation email sent:\", res.status);",
              "    }",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
