        "description": "Sends a notification email to your staff/team when a new Contact Form 7 submission is received via the UACF7 webhook.\n\n### Authentication\nUses Bearer token auth with `{{resend_api_key}}`. Set this variable in the collection before running.\n\n### Sender Requirements\nThe `{{sender_email}}` must be from a domain **verified in your Resend account**. Unverified domains will be rejected by Resend.\n\n### Variables Used\n| Variable | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `{{sender_email}}` | From address (must be Resend-verified) |\n| `{{notification_email}}` | Recipient — your staff/team email |\n| `{{form_name}}` | Submitter's name (set by Receive request) |\n| `{{form_email}}` | Submitter's email (set by Receive request) |\n| `{{form_message}}` | Submitter's message (set by Receive request) |\n| `{{submitted_at}}` | Submission timestamp (set by Receive request) |"
      },
