        "description": "Sends an automatic confirmation email to the person who submitted the Contact Form 7 form via UACF7, letting them know their message was received.\n\n### Authentication\nUses `{{resend_api_key}}` passed as a Bearer token in the `Authorization` header.\n\n### Sender Requirements\nThe `{{sender_email}}` must be from a domain **verified in your Resend account**.\n\n### Variables Used\n| Variable | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `{{sender_email}}` | From address (must be Resend-verified) |\n| `{{form_email}}` | Recipient — the form submitter's email address |\n| `{{form_name}}` | Submitter's name, included in the email body |\n| `{{form_message}}` | Submitter's message, echoed back in the confirmation |\n| `{{submitted_at}}` | Submission timestamp |\n\n### Note\nThis request is triggered automatically by the post-response script on the **Receive Form Submission** request. You can also run it manually to test the confirmation email independently."
